Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,畫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是真島嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,對 確實是真島
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,這可太抽象了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你畫的漫畫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不可靠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都說了不像
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不像
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才讓你們畫的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等司令
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我畫的像
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那蜂斗來畫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你們見過真島
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我畫個屁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,對哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真笨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.91,0:00:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris也該必修繪畫了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,躲開了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你的槍法太爛了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 這距離不可能偏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,還有她反擊都沒有猶豫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果心裡沒數是做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼來頭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,明天午休阿部也來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那時分鏡稿就畫完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:02:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,漫畫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你上個月也這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要緊 還有一晚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那期待明天桌遊會了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對畫不完
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 反正她明天沒戲唱你準備好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,因為上次輸慘了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我還得去日語學校幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 嚇跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,沒跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那 我去歇會
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快點回來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,去把午餐結束的標牌掛出來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,標牌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我去趟廁所就去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,BAR forbidden
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,拉不出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,回家再喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺你今天好怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她哪天不怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,老師呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才好像回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼 千束看上大叔了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,這是LycoReco關店危機
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,別偷看別人的手機啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但就是看見了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,眼神好了就會看到太多東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,比如內褲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼知道是楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 也不一定是司令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定計劃勸老師讓我回DA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很驕傲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,被需要真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這意思瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那和關店有什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然這裡小 但也是DA支部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,主力Lycoris不在也沒有存在的意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那我回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,別啊 那樣太寂寞了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是點名要你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,失言了 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,要是關店了你們不煩惱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那我可能要回育成所
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不潛伏在這裡可能小命不保
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我就沒地方邂逅男人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Forbidden
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,搜尋引擎查不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:06:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,會員製酒吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,進得去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,這就輪到電腦高手出馬了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,偽造很輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你該工作勤快點的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在這種店裡會聊工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一般都是約會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以店長和司令是情人關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,情人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.01,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,居然從你嘴裡說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺有點興奮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但不就這麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼 是有可能的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 找到可能有關的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有記錄和她一樣用非殺傷彈戰鬥的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,或者說是傳言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道電視塔事件吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,知道 畢竟是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然後呢 傳言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖分子被單槍匹馬幹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,確實是一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但記得是小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不過好假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,這種多少有點誇大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到是同一人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,當時束手無策啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼非得到場插這東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,DA系統被超級AI把持著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不準備物理接入的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦訪問我們就會暴露
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然不明白 你不能整簡單點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是世界第一的駭客嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,能做出來這個的只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,已經沒有別人能破解DA的AI了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果辦成了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界將認可我的地位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.87,0:08:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 這攸關你的夢想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我辦不到世上就沒人能辦到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,插進局長的電腦就行唄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這對於完成你的計劃是必要的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是我們的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,總之 電波干擾和撤退路線安排一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,頂級駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,5分鐘就完事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,發現都內有21個場所需要對應
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiata確認多個爆炸物持有者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,同時嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,各方面正前往現場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好 這就對了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,散開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.93,0:09:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是Charlie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,到達現場F7
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:10.65,Top,,0,0,0,,沒有找到目標
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,合成影像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.77,0:09:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,被算計了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,迅速召回Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris真不會來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在就不會重蹈地鐵事件的覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但只是減緩了她們的反應速度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,搞快點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,用的什麼手段
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,DA終究也是人類運營的組織
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,首先讓指揮…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,還是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,反正聽不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你們 別在警察面前弄這種玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.93,0:09:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 只有這種玩具了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,午間新聞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,昨夜警局發生惡性事件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在被暴力團襲擊的警局現場
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,現場附近散有疑似開槍留下的彈殼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可見事件的嚴重性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害的紋身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,現在真少見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,千束在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 蜂斗 歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不用說明了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,給你看樣東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,都來看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,沒見過你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我DA的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,對 我們的電腦高手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.11,0:10:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那稍微借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,局裡的監控錄影
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不是紋身啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,當然是消息封鎖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但防止發生不是你們的工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是稀客呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,來份糰子套餐可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.05,0:10:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抹茶味的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,抹茶糰子套餐是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不必了 在執行任務呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 快看是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,別吼那麼大聲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是他是他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 我髮型畫對了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不就顏色一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,形狀也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,櫻 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的糰子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.57,0:11:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.90,0:11:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,已確認
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是真島
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了糰子再走不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼老在三賀面前那麼矜持
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,煮烏龍麵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我也吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我有事出趟門
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,別忘了鎖門
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,忘說了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,燃氣閥別忘了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 烏龍麵放哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:32.54,Top,,0,0,0,,烏龍麵 烏龍麵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡沒有烏龍麵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,烏龍麵在倉庫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你們準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.69,0:12:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,早上看電視有亞倫的人奪冠了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定我也有天賦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,躲子彈又不是誰都能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那是直覺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只要比子彈快就能奪冠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫看走眼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.35,0:13:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡右轉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就算沒有金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也能助人為樂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,回DA還不是時候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,這氣氛好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,開門了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.06,0:13:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是核桃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,任務開始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,方便確認一下姓名嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,芥末海苔子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲燒太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲燒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有這樣的假名嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.49,0:13:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,確認好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,蒲燒太郎先生 這邊請
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真假
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只相信數據的人只會越來越蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要注意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,請慢用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,店長來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老師穿的還挺板正
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是約會
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,趁楠木沒來還是先溜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,誰來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 是吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.89,0:14:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真是約會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.79,0:14:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,失算了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,原來三賀是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你們不早說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 別打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,愛的形式有很多啊 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉突然約你出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有事想問你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 那麼嚴肅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟是店裡常客
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,打個招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事 待會告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,術後 我把那孩子託付給你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了那意味著什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得為什麼要救千束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:31.82,Top,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.66,Top,,0,0,0,,要被發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那心臟也是亞倫才能的結晶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是吉叔嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是吉叔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂 幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我們上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是吉叔嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不小心看到了老師的簡訊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,以為和司令見面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 剛才說的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就一會 讓我和吉叔聊聊好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我先出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到是吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 應該叫你吉松先生嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,感激不盡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,術後一直沒機會向你道謝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.57,0:16:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我無法承認此事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這是規矩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想用得到的時間像吉叔一樣去幫助…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是Lycoris吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,差別對待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是未成年禁止入內
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好好看ID啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不寫著30歲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,典 這家店也以貌取人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然看起來十來歲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我已經20了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不是說你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想用男人的錢喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫兒童有各自的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,和三賀聊聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在這稍等一會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.75,0:17:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我在店裡等你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,伸二 我讓仁走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,以前你還沒那麼慈悲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,留給千束她想要的時間吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀 才能是神的施捨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不是人的所有物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,更不是我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不是約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,讓千束自由
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我有覺悟扣下扳機
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次去你的店裡的那天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我心潮澎湃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就像十年前那天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面 我是吉松伸二
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我們各自秘密都挺多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我們能做好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了 三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,約好了 要把才能獻給世界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那稀世的殺戮才能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,請留步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉方才打擾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但千束很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我們在店裡等你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,千束一直在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.40,0:19:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,千束的舞台不在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我很期待你 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼瞞著我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那是為了救你答應的條件
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你遵守了諾言
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這才像老師的作風
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,厲害啊 竟敢騙千束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事 別介意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,千束呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今天還沒來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.15,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,伊藤不參加嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你手機一直在響
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.15,0:20:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是編輯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,沒響
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 到頭來還是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 反派還是應該殺掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.59,0:20:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞希 你大白天的穿成什麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞希要出門嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,正妹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,當然是昨天的高級酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:20:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然帶孩子進不去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:21:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但我一個人就沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,用這個金卡進去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,ID已經刪掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼 那是高級酒吧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因為你太低級了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 坐下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 我絕對去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 這野狗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:17.29,Top,,0,0,0,,還是母狗 走開啊母狗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,今天讓她休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,千束來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,來了 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 快來快來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,最新話畫好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.18,0:21:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:33.66,Top,,0,0,0,,千束 來玩桌遊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,午休快結束了 趕緊的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:39.06,Top,,0,0,0,,千束 來份超級帕菲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 這邊可是正經事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.35,0:21:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼殺了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,別殺掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 已經開始營業了快去換衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,沒你幫我可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我馬上就回來 不然瀧奈要發火了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好的老師 這就去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我們有各自的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她的使命是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.98,0:23:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,闖警局
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不用玩的那麼大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,果然封鎖消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好 成功接入了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,OK 做得漂亮駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然後
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.29,0:23:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,大的要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:58.29,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}君が持ってきた漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:01.30,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}くれた知らない名前のお花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今日はまだ来ないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:07.30,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}初めての感情知ってしまった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:13.22,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:18.56,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}それだけでいいはずだったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.56,0:22:24.90,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君の手を握ってしまったら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:31.12,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}孤独を知らないこの街には
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:41.88,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:53.26,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:59.10,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}歌って聞かせてこの話の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.10,0:23:08.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}連れて行って見たことない星まで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:58.29,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}你送我的漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:01.30,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}和不知名的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.92,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今天還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:07.30,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}這種感情初次體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:13.22,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在窗上臨摹塗鴉  獨自前往星辰大海
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:18.56,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}我本該心滿意足
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.56,0:22:24.90,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}直到握住你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:31.12,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在這不懂孤獨的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:41.88,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}已經再也回不到從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:53.26,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}你伸出了手  光影伴生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:59.10,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}聽我歌唱 聽我訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.10,0:23:08.11,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}帶我去未知的星球
